		Heading 1:
			Text: Horizontal in a row
		Paragraph: In a `Stack` with `Direction: horizontal`, `Horizontal` says where the leftover space goes when no item grows. `justify` puts it between the items and `distribute` makes every gap equal, also at the edges.
